years. In addition, at all times during the second half of each taxable year,
no more than 50% in value of our stock may be owned, directly or indirectly,
by five or fewer individuals (determined with attribution to the owners of
any entity owning our stock). However, these two requirements do not apply
until after the first taxable year an entity elects REIT status. In addition,
our charter contains provisions restricting the transfer of our stock, which
