         and certain state securities commissioners, such indemnification is
         contrary to public policy and, therefore, unenforceable.

                  ix. GOVERNING LAW. This DRP shall be governed by the laws of
         the State of Maryland. However, causes of action for violations of
         federal or state securities laws shall not be governed by this Section
